NOTE ON CONTENT:

The MIT license above applies to the Foundry VTT system code (module/, css/,
templates/, system.json, lang/, src/packs/ schemas, etc.).

The bundled rules content under packs/ and src/packs/ — including but not
limited to backgrounds, traits, monsters, spellbooks, weapons, armor, gear,
consumables, ammunition, loot, and the rules-reference journal — is derived
from the MCDM Crows TTRPG public playtest packet (May-June 2026), © MCDM
Productions. It is bundled here as a community service to facilitate playtest
participation. If MCDM Productions requests removal, the repository will be
taken down immediately.
